{%- comment -%}
  GROUP BUY BANK PAYMENT ORDERING (register D12, owner decision: this is a
  launch blocker, not deferrable).

  Replaces the "Contact us to arrange payment" link that stood here while no
  Group Buy Bank Payment endpoint existed. One does now —
  `POST /apps/carat/group-buy-bank-checkout`
  (app/app/routes/apps.carat.group-buy-bank-checkout.tsx) — and it has been
  live and tested for some time with nothing calling it. This snippet is the
  caller.

  ============================================================================
  THE CARD AND BANK ACKNOWLEDGMENT MECHANISMS ARE SEPARATE, DELIBERATELY
  ============================================================================
  The Card path captures its acknowledgment up front through
  `/apps/carat/group-buy-cancellation-acknowledgment`, receives an
  acknowledgment id, and carries it on the cart line as
  `properties[_carat_gb_cancel_ack]` — because native Shopify checkout
  creates the order, so the evidence must exist BEFORE the order does and
  must travel with it.

  The Bank path does NOT do that, and must not be "unified" with it for
  symmetry. It calls no capture endpoint and sends no acknowledgment id from
  the browser. It sends one thing: `cancellationAcknowledgmentAccepted: true`,
  and only after the customer has actually checked the box. The route builds
  the `Acknowledgment` row server-side, inside the same transaction as the
  order, with the AUTHENTICATED `customerGid` — and
  `GroupBuyBankPaymentOrder.cancellationAcknowledgmentId` is a NOT NULL
  foreign key to it, so an order cannot exist in Postgres without one.

  A browser-supplied acknowledgment id would be strictly weaker here: it
  would let a caller present an id they did not earn. The two mechanisms
  differ because the two order-creation paths differ; the EVIDENCE STANDARD
  does not differ, and `groupBuyAcknowledgmentEvidenceParity.test.ts` pins
  that (same policy slug, same current policy version, same exact approved
  copy, same affirmative-action label, authenticated customerGid, same
  campaign reference, campaign must be open, fail closed when policy
  configuration is unavailable).

  ============================================================================
  THE CHECKBOX IS A UX GATE, NOT THE ENFORCEMENT
  ============================================================================
  Same as the Card path's own comment: this markup cannot stop a direct POST.
  The route's `z.literal(true)` and its NOT NULL FK are the enforcement. What
  this file must get right is narrower and still matters — never send
  `true` for a box the customer did not tick.

  ============================================================================
  NO COORDINATES HERE
  ============================================================================
  Zelle recipient, bank name, routing and account numbers are never rendered
  by Liquid. They arrive in the response and are written with `textContent`
  by `group-buy-campaign.js`. A theme file is public and cacheable.

  Field markup follows `snippets/bank-payment-checkout-dialog.liquid`
  exactly — `.field`/`.field__input`/`.field__label`/`.form__message` are
  existing Dawn classes reused, not reinvented — and the field LABELS reuse
  that dialog's `sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.*` keys, because
  they are literally the same fields asking for the same thing. Only the
  Group-Buy-specific copy is new.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="carat-gb-bank" data-carat-gb-bank hidden>
  <h3 class="carat-gb-bank__heading">
    {{- 'templates.group_buy_campaign.bank_form_heading' | t -}}
  </h3>
  <p class="carat-gb-bank__intro">
    {{- 'templates.group_buy_campaign.bank_form_intro' | t -}}
  </p>

  {%- comment -%}
    Starts empty and hidden; never removed from the DOM, so JS only ever
    toggles `hidden` and writes into the same node.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div
    id="CaratGbBankErrorSummary-{{ section.id }}"
    class="carat-gb-bank__error-summary form-status-list"
    role="alert"
    tabindex="-1"
    hidden
    data-carat-gb-bank-error-summary
  ></div>

  <form id="CaratGbBankForm-{{ section.id }}" novalidate data-carat-gb-bank-form>
    <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
      <input
        type="email"
        id="CaratGbBankEmail-{{ section.id }}"
        name="email"
        class="field__input"
        autocomplete="email"
        spellcheck="false"
        autocapitalize="off"
        required
        placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.email_label' | t }}"
        value="{{ customer.email | escape }}"
        aria-describedby="CaratGbBankEmail-{{ section.id }}-error"
      >
      <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankEmail-{{ section.id }}">
        {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.email_label' | t }}
        <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
      >
      <small
        id="CaratGbBankEmail-{{ section.id }}-error"
        class="carat-gb-bank__field-error form__message"
        hidden
        data-carat-gb-bank-field-error
      >
        <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
        <span data-carat-gb-bank-field-error-text></span>
      </small>
    </div>

    <fieldset class="carat-gb-bank__fieldset">
      <legend class="carat-gb-bank__legend">
        {{- 'templates.group_buy_campaign.bank_shipping_legend' | t -}}
      </legend>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratGbBankFirstName-{{ section.id }}"
          name="firstName"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="given-name"
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.first_name_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.first_name | escape }}"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankFirstName-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.first_name_label' | t -}}
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratGbBankLastName-{{ section.id }}"
          name="lastName"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="family-name"
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.last_name_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.last_name | escape }}"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankLastName-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.last_name_label' | t -}}
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratGbBankAddress1-{{ section.id }}"
          name="address1"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="address-line1"
          required
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.address1_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.address1 | escape }}"
          aria-describedby="CaratGbBankAddress1-{{ section.id }}-error"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankAddress1-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.address1_label' | t }}
          <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
        >
        <small
          id="CaratGbBankAddress1-{{ section.id }}-error"
          class="carat-gb-bank__field-error form__message"
          hidden
          data-carat-gb-bank-field-error
        >
          <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          <span data-carat-gb-bank-field-error-text></span>
        </small>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratGbBankAddress2-{{ section.id }}"
          name="address2"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="address-line2"
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.address2_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.address2 | escape }}"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankAddress2-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.address2_label' | t -}}
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratGbBankCity-{{ section.id }}"
          name="city"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="address-level2"
          required
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.city_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.city | escape }}"
          aria-describedby="CaratGbBankCity-{{ section.id }}-error"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankCity-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.city_label' | t }}
          <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
        >
        <small
          id="CaratGbBankCity-{{ section.id }}-error"
          class="carat-gb-bank__field-error form__message"
          hidden
          data-carat-gb-bank-field-error
        >
          <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          <span data-carat-gb-bank-field-error-text></span>
        </small>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratGbBankProvince-{{ section.id }}"
          name="provinceCode"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="address-level1"
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.province_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.province_code | escape }}"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankProvince-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.province_label' | t -}}
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratGbBankZip-{{ section.id }}"
          name="zip"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="postal-code"
          required
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.zip_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.zip | escape }}"
          aria-describedby="CaratGbBankZip-{{ section.id }}-error"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankZip-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.zip_label' | t }}
          <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
        >
        <small
          id="CaratGbBankZip-{{ section.id }}-error"
          class="carat-gb-bank__field-error form__message"
          hidden
          data-carat-gb-bank-field-error
        >
          <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          <span data-carat-gb-bank-field-error-text></span>
        </small>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankCountry-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.country_label' | t }}
          <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
        >
        <div class="select">
          <select
            id="CaratGbBankCountry-{{ section.id }}"
            name="countryCode"
            class="select__select"
            autocomplete="country"
            required
            aria-describedby="CaratGbBankCountry-{{ section.id }}-error"
          >
            {% render 'bank-checkout-country-options', selected_country_code: customer.default_address.country_code %}
          </select>
          <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
        </div>
        <small
          id="CaratGbBankCountry-{{ section.id }}-error"
          class="carat-gb-bank__field-error form__message"
          hidden
          data-carat-gb-bank-field-error
        >
          <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          <span data-carat-gb-bank-field-error-text></span>
        </small>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-gb-bank__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="tel"
          id="CaratGbBankPhone-{{ section.id }}"
          name="phone"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="tel"
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.phone_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.phone | escape }}"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratGbBankPhone-{{ section.id }}">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.phone_label' | t -}}
        </label>
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <div class="carat-gb-bank__actions">
      <button type="submit" class="button button--full-width" data-carat-gb-bank-submit disabled>
        <span>{{ 'templates.group_buy_campaign.bank_submit' | t }}</span>
        {%- render 'loading-spinner' -%}
      </button>
    </div>

    <p class="carat-gb-bank__status" role="status" data-carat-gb-bank-status hidden></p>
  </form>
</div>
